sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTP API
    participant S as SQLite document store
    participant I as Index manager
    participant W as Snapshot writer

    C->>H: PUT /v1/indexes/{index}/documents/{id}
    H->>H: Validate path, content type, body, and fields
    H->>S: Transactional source-document upsert
    S-->>H: New document version
    H->>I: Tokenize and update postings
    I->>W: Write generation staging file
    W->>W: Rename generation, then manifest
    W-->>I: Published index version
    I-->>H: Search-visible result
    H-->>C: 200 version + indexVersion

    Note over C,W: Phase 2 will insert a durable job in the SQLite transaction and return 202 before the worker runs.
